    narr:narration """This actor hub holds two registers. The long spine is [a single assertion repeated near-daily](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1) from the first dated entry through [the latest repetition](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260926_2_E2EDefaultRef1790414711576_hf13014451375_1), with [an alternate dated log](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788341794428_1) in the same cadence — claim-level conviction in a concrete, present-tense, realis frame throughout. From late in the span a second register appears: [a ruling issued in an owner capacity](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1), its substance — [one bundle per run per person](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2) — argued in plain-spoken antithesis, [a boundary held against pushback](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), and [a rejected alternative recorded with its reason](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5), re-voiced across [a second rendering](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1), [a third](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_1), [a fourth](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_1), and [a fifth](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_1). The newest ruling child extends the register: [a weekly roll-up added on Fridays](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2), with [the run-versus-week scope clarified](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4), [a question about replacement answered](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3), and [a daily digest rejected as redundant](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5). A query for anything beyond the repeated assertion and these delivery-routing rulings is honestly not-here.""" ;
    narr:reaction """One thing moved since you last reviewed: the ruling register gained [a fifth rendering of the routing rule](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_1) and [one more repetition of the standing assertion](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260926_2_E2EDefaultRef1790414711576_hf13014451375_1), so the arc now extends later — but the shape is unchanged, and the prior narration still holds. The two registers remain distinct, and no new tension appeared beyond what was already surfaced.""" ;
